#sortorder:2
#showas:王室之痛
Adding a lot of factions or exotic settings is only one way to spice up a game;  another is to just take on one of the more challenging AI types.  

This scenario does that with the two Brutal options in the vanilla set;  Golemite and Royal.  Golemite utilizes Golems to defend some of their planets, while Royal has access to much more powerful versions of Guardians to make your life miserable.  

Additionally, both AIs use the most intelligent protocols for their Warden & Hunter fleets;  Kite Master, which ensures they will snipe from distance whenever possible.